sleep so I can see you","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"And I hate to wait so long","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B6","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"She took my fingers to her mouth","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"The kind of thing that makes you proud","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B6","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"That nothing else had ever","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Worked out, worked out","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B6","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"And lately, I've tried other things","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"But nothing can capture the sting","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B6","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"Of the venom, she's gonna spit out right now","columns":44,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":16,"beat":2},{"symbol":"B6","column":32,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão 2]","columns":10,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, won't you kiss me on the mouth","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E7M","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"And love me like a sailor?","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":